      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5bc63165b150d502fa6164e3|full_name}: There are a few ways around it, but they are not beginner-friendly.  TeleportTo is, however, hopeless at the moment due to the rotation issue and not being able to prefab it, so we will need to use one of the more complex methods.",
